# Quick save / quick load (Ctrl+S / Ctrl+O, quick slot 9) regression test.
# New game -> l/001 -> Ctrl+S -> walk to l/005 -> Ctrl+O must return to l/001 ->
# Ctrl+S again must overwrite the slot cleanly (name "Quicksave", not appended).
# Guards: quick save/load at the main menu, during the opening monologue and without a
# quick save must be rejected without injecting any input.
# Macros run atomically from the script's point of view (the script is paused).
wait video 60
1000 tap Escape
wait menu 60
1500 quicksave
+300 quickload
+1500 expect menu
1500 click 60 553
wait room x/006 30
1500 click 114 566
+2000 tap Escape
wait room l/001 30
500 quicksave
+2500 click 400 300
+2500 click 400 300
+2500 click 400 300
+2500 click 400 300
+2500 click 400 300
+11000 expect hotspots 15
+0 key down Left Ctrl
+50 tap S
+100 key up Left Ctrl
3000 expect room l/001
+0 savecheck 9
+0 clickspot Tür
wait room l/005 30
3000 key down Left Ctrl
+50 tap O
+100 key up Left Ctrl
wait room l/001 30
3000 expect room l/001
+0 shot 01_after_quickload
+0 expect hotspots 15
+0 key down Left Ctrl
+50 tap S
+100 key up Left Ctrl
3000 tap Escape
wait room x/006 15
1500 shotfull 02_slot_label
+0 tap Escape
wait leave x/006 15
2000 expect room l/001
+500 quit
